WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.500
<v Mira Holt>The main problem is people arriving when every stand is taken.</v>

2
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.000
<v Mira Holt>If we fix that, the Saturday runs itself.</v>

3
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:19.000
<v Tomas Reed>Half the calls I get are people asking whether there is space.</v>

4
00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:26.000
<v Ana Lund>Showing free slots and taking a booking is simple. Do we need accounts?</v>

5
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:31.000
<v Mira Holt>A name and a phone number. No accounts, and no recurring bookings in the first release.</v>

6
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.000
<v Tomas Reed>Someone asked whether we could take card payments for parts.</v>

7
00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:39.000
<v Mira Holt>Not now. Payments are out of scope.</v>
